<view class="page resource-editor-page"><view class="title">资源编辑</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="state">正在验证权限…</view><view wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}" class="state"><view class="status-empty-title">暂时无法打开编辑器</view><view>{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:else><view class="notice">{{resourceStatus === 'published' ? '已发布，当前只读。' : '草稿仅运营可见。'}} 原创内容可全文发布；转载内容请确认授权，或使用摘要并注明来源。</view><view class="card editor-card"><label class="label">标题 *</label><input value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" placeholder="例如：医学背景转医疗 AI 的第一步" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><label class="label">导语摘要 *</label><textarea value="{{form.summary}}" data-field="summary" bindinput="input" maxlength="1200" placeholder="用 1–3 句话说明这篇内容写给谁、能解决什么问题。" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><view class="label">分类 *</view><view class="choice-row"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{form.category === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectCategory" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}">{{item.label}}</button></view></view><view class="card editor-card"><view class="editor-row"><view><view class="subtitle">封面图片</view><view class="form-hint">可选；建议横图，单张不超过 5MB。</view></view><button wx:if="{{resourceStatus === 'draft'}}" class="secondary compact-button" loading="{{uploading}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading}}" bindtap="chooseCover">{{form.coverFileId ? '更换封面' : '上传封面'}}</button></view><image wx:if="{{coverPreviewUrl}}" class="cover-preview" src="{{coverPreviewUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button wx:if="{{form.coverFileId && resourceStatus === 'draft'}}" class="link-button" bindtap="clearCover">移除封面</button></view><view class="card editor-card"><view class="subtitle">正文</view><view class="form-hint">按顺序添加段落、小标题、引用和图片；最多 32 个内容块、6 张正文图片。</view><view wx:if="{{!form.blocks.length}}" class="editor-empty">还没有正文内容。先添加一个段落开始写吧。</view><view wx:for="{{form.blocks}}" wx:key="index" class="block-editor"><view class="block-toolbar"><text>{{item.type === 'heading' ? '小标题' : item.type === 'quote' ? '引用' : item.type === 'image' ? '图片' : '段落'}}</text><view wx:if="{{resourceStatus === 'draft'}}"><button class="block-action" data-index="{{index}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="moveBlock">↑</button><button class="block-action" data-index="{{index}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="moveBlock">↓</button><button class="block-action danger" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeBlock">删除</button></view></view><textarea wx:if="{{item.type !== 'image'}}" class="block-textarea {{item.type}}" value="{{item.text}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="blockInput" maxlength="{{item.type === 'heading' ? 120 : item.type === 'quote' ? 600 : 3000}}" placeholder="{{item.type === 'heading' ? '写一个小标题' : item.type === 'quote' ? '写一段引用' : '写正文段落'}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><image wx:elif="{{item.previewUrl}}" class="block-image" src="{{item.previewUrl}}" mode="widthFix"/><view wx:else class="editor-empty">图片预览暂不可用，发布后请在阅读页核对。</view></view><view wx:if="{{resourceStatus === 'draft'}}" class="block-adders"><button class="secondary" data-type="paragraph" bindtap="addTextBlock">+ 段落</button><button class="secondary" data-type="heading" bindtap="addTextBlock">+ 小标题</button><button class="secondary" data-type="quote" bindtap="addTextBlock">+ 引用</button><button class="secondary" loading="{{uploading}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading}}" bindtap="addImageBlock">+ 插入图片</button></view></view><view class="card editor-card"><view class="subtitle">来源与署名</view><label class="label">来源说明（可选）</label><input value="{{form.sourceLabel}}" data-field="sourceLabel" bindinput="input" maxlength="160" placeholder="例如：未界原创 / 访谈整理 / 某公众号（已获授权）" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><label class="label">来源 HTTPS 链接（可选）</label><input value="{{form.sourceUrl}}" data-field="sourceUrl" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="https://…" disabled="{{busy || uploading || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><view class="form-hint">外部链接会以“复制链接”方式提供给用户；发布时至少需要正文、图文内容或来源链接之一。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice form-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view><block wx:if="{{resourceStatus === 'draft'}}"><button class="secondary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading}}" bindtap="save">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || uploading || dirty || !version}}" bindtap="publish">发布资源</button><view wx:if="{{dirty || !version}}" class="form-hint">请先保存当前内容，再发布。</view></block></view></view>
